# Baseline for oasdiff breaking --fail-on ERR --err-ignore.
# Each active line ignores one ERR-level change: method+path and description,
# in any order or case (see oasdiff docs/BREAKING-CHANGES.md).
# Empty (comments only) means no exceptions: every ERR fails the gate.
# Must-resolve: contract_check.py fails if these entries match nothing,
# so stale ignores cannot linger. Resolve, do not extend.
active-ignore-for-stale-test GET /items api-path-removed-without-deprecation
